<p>In your case something like;</p>

<pre><code>allprojects {
    repositories {
        jcenter()
        maven { url 'https://maven.fabric.io/public' }  // &lt;= ADD THIS
        maven {
            url "https://maven.google.com"
        }
    }
}
</code></pre>

<p>Also if you want to add the latest <strong>Firebase libraries v. 11.2.0</strong> you have to add the same repo as <a href="https://developers.google.com/android/guides/releases#august_2017_-_version_1120" rel="nofollow noreferrer">described here</a>.</p>

