A: <p>For a non-trivial generator function, you will want to use some sort of tool to translate your code to an ES3 equivalent so that it can run in any modern browser. I recommend trying out <a href="http://traceur-compiler.googlecode.com/" rel="noreferrer">Traceur</a>, which can roughly be described as an ES6-to-ES3 source translator. Because generators are a language feature destined for ES6, Traceur will be able to translate them for you.</p>

