</code></pre>

<p>Instead of:</p>

<pre><code>&lt;div class="field-name-field-rating2 rating-1"&gt;
&lt;div class="field-name-field-rating2 rating-5"&gt;
&lt;div class="field-name-field-rating2 rating-8"&gt;
</code></pre>

